      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MINI MARA (1) turned in a plain run last time when sixth at this track over 340m behind Rupee's Revenge (20.25) in a Grade 4. Was in the money prior to that. Form is hard to fault from this box, with a win and two minor placings from three starts. Tough to beat if on-song. YOU WHO (2) made light work of a wide draw last time with a slick early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing third (19.78) at this track over 340m. Form from her last run is proving strong. Bold showing expected. CARISSA'S BABY (3) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Aariella's Girl (19.54) in a Grade 4. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Hard to beat again. INSPECTOR FRANK (8) jumps at a shorter distance and still warrants respect.",
